      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this is fragile because we don\u0027t really enforce this in AIDL. If someone makes a typo in the constant name, this will break. I think, it\u0027s more reliable to test against enum values explicitly, e.g. `\u003d\u003d AudioFlag.SYS_RESERVED_SCO` etc.",
